sequenceDiagram
    Browser->>reservation: POST /bookings (JWT)
    reservation->>reservation: validate JWT locally
    reservation->>catalog: GET car (no transaction open)
    reservation->>DB: insert booking + booking_day + outbox + audit (1 tx)
    alt (car_id, day) collides
      DB-->>Browser: 409 Conflict
    end
    Browser->>payment: POST /payments
    payment->>reservation: confirm (SERVICE token)
